    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40348" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίνοσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>subject to sickness,
				unhealthy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1113a28
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				20.48
			</span></i> Schneider, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				2.48
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενεά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.516
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-σως</span>
			<i>like one who is sick</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					1.5
				</span></i>
			, Crates <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. διακειμένου</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ σώματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.117
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				939.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. <i>unwholesome</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Abst.</u>
					1.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Gp.</u>
					1.12.34
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hierocl.
					<u>Facet.</u>
					73
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατομβρία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyd.
					<u>Ost.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			.</div>
